{"detail": {"templateUuid": "ad053e11505e4197a43f15f05427e483", "projectUuid": "e02dfd62fb6345e2b54e0f1aaa2d86cd", "name": "你不看我我也要把你喝掉", "description": "本作品以经典旺仔牛奶广告为创作蓝本，以“反差感”与“心理拉扯”为核心创意进行二次创作。\n故事将原版标志性的“眼神互动”“你在看我我就把你喝掉”重构为一场诙谐的智斗：当小男孩期待与旺仔对视时，罐身上的旺仔却出人意料地通过戴墨镜、闭眼假睡等微表情巧妙躲避，打破常规期待。小男孩则机智利用小小酥进行反制，最终小男孩顺利喝上旺仔牛奶收尾。\n视觉上保留了经典的居家生活场景，唤醒童年情怀的同时，赋予品牌经典IP更具时代感的互动趣味与传播张力。", "coverUrl": "/assets/8e21277964b5a7dc.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/56f16240970e44f0aecf050f8292769e/72a6c311617329de3601fc09a051ee624d78fb65.mp4", "snapshotId": 39048, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 6506744, "ownerUuid": "56f16240970e44f0aecf050f8292769e", "avatar": "/assets/0db80f5b5fefcb21.webp", "nickname": "不是猫Notcat", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 62, "tags": [{"id": 1101, "code": "product_show", "tagLabel": "产品展示", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1101/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://v.douyin.com/4PFoTBm6DGU/ Zzt:/ x@S.lP :8pm 10/02   https://xhslink.cn/o/9eTfVilGtD2", "createAt": "2026年08月20日 15:55", "updateAt": "2026年08月20日 23:22", "publishAt": "2026年08月20日 15:55", "playCount": 606, "viewCreationProcessCount": 301, "copyCanvasCount": 38, "shareCount": 5, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/ad053e11505e4197a43f15f05427e483.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 85, "edges": 196}}, "recommendList": []}